---
// Componente botão flutuante WhatsApp pulsante
---

<a
  href="https://wa.me/5511999999999?text=Ola%20GetNexo"
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
  class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-green-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-green-600/50 hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300 animate-pulse-slow group"
  aria-label="Conversar no WhatsApp"
>
  <span class="text-white text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">💬</span>
</a>

<style>
  @keyframes pulse-slow {
    0% { transform: scale(1); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.08); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); }
  }
  .animate-pulse-slow {
    animation: pulse-slow 2s infinite;
  }
</style>